  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional Assessment of BELA</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">institutionell bed&#xf6;mningen av BELA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen inneb&#xe4;r genomf&#xf6;randet av en bed&#xf6;mning av organisationen BELA:s l&#xe4;mplighet (System Audit - intern styrning, ledningssystem, bokf&#xf6;ring, etc.) som mottagare av svenska bist&#xe5;ndsmedel. Tj&#xe4;nsten kommer att avropas fr&#xe5;n ambassadens ramavtal f&#xf6;r revisionstj&#xe4;nster.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contribution is the performance of the consultancy service to assess the organizational capacity of BELA through analyzing the organizations&apos; internal management and control systems whether they guarantee the quality and accuracy of documentation. It will also evaluate the existing routine management system of BELA towards operational goals and contribution to the fulfillment of the goals of Swedish development cooperation and will be procured using the embassy&apos;s call off framework for auditing services.</narrative>
  </description>
